        "image_mask": "portrait",
        "image2_mask": "square",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "The 24-Plant Farmstand",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "text": "<p>Lettuce Grow CEO, Jacob Pechenik, said it best...</p><ul><li><h4><em>It’s the magic. </em></h4></li><li><h4><em>It’s sharing the feeling of growing your own food, of being a farmer.</em></h4></li><li><h4><em>Of creating and observing life. </em></h4></li><li><h4><em>Of enjoying the bees and the butterflies. </em></h4></li><li><h4><em>Of watching kids sneak off, stealing fresh produce off of the Farmstand, and popping it into their mouths between giggles.</em></h4></li></ul><p>Grow fresh veggies, herbs, greens, and edible flowers with our self-watering, self-fertilizing hydroponic system, The Farmstand. Grow outdoors all year long (40-100°F) or move it inside with the additional purchase of our LED Glow Rings®. Plus, the Farmstand’s modular design allows for growing between 18 - 36 plants. Simply start off with the size that’s right for your household and add an extension kit anytime.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "right",
        "color_scheme": "none",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false,
