    "6a2fb62f-79e7-42de-acea-4e5fab243fb0": {
      "type": "columns-1",
      "blocks": {
        "96a58abe-15e9-41be-a763-825ae0982e23": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "How do I assemble my Farmstand?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZhVwnebig18\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZhVwnebig18\">Click here to check our complete guide</a> to getting started with your Farmstand. We can't wait to get growing with you!</p>",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "59261c80-e8c7-47c3-a3f2-ff02cf967f67": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What are the recommended watering cycles?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p> </p>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/Mechanical_Water__Irrigation_Cycle_Chart_070623.jpg",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "71949193-2fe9-4957-8c4d-795f5bf9560b": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What should I do if it rains?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>You do not have to change anything when it rains! There's no need to change your watering cycle as your seedlings will naturally dry out after it rains. The silicone gaskets included with your Farmstand components will keep your electrical connections dry.</p><p>Check your electrical connections after a heavy rain to ensure that your seedlings will continue getting the water they need. Then be sure to check your water's pH level as heavy or sustained rain can affect your pH level.</p><p>If you have young seedlings and the weather forecast calls for more than 9+ consecutive days of rain with no sun, you may want to move or cover your Farmstand.</p>",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "8082b681-7db6-4ae6-b9ae-eed5c28bd7bc": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "How do I do weekly maintenance?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>The Farmstand’s weekly maintenance is super simple! All you need to do is fill your Farmstand’s tank with water, add nutrients, and test and adjust your water’s pH. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b6KQ0Tjemrc\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b6KQ0Tjemrc\">Watch the video for more information!</a></p>",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        }
      },
